    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Replace chat input with durable owner evidence**\n\nWhen another session executes Task 2, the referenced “current conversation” may be unavailable or may no longer contain the original OWNER directive, so the worker cannot verify the contract and must either block or reconstruct it from memory. Bind this input to an immutable GitHub comment/archive event instead; the repository explicitly makes GitHub authoritative and chat memory non-authoritative.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L24-L26](https://github.com/Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-shared-hq/blob/69c2e4ab386b78680e35d5b9ff83efa305c53048/AGENTS.md#L24-L26)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
